 Q2AieN0QhlA,UCXzNNA2ngRpRiWvyA7eGd6w,Nick Invests,How $100 a Month Could Change Your Future,39434,TYPICAL,2026-09-11,COMPLETE_LIMITED_EVIDENCE,INDIVIDUAL_PUBLIC_EVIDENCE,"[""VIDEO_MASTER.csv:Q2AieN0QhlA"", ""TRANSCRIPT_COVERAGE.csv:Q2AieN0QhlA"", ""audit-batches/NICK_147_READ_RECEIPTS.json"", ""PERFORMANCE_SENSITIVITY.csv:Q2AieN0QhlA""]","Observed result: 39,434 frozen views at 398.3483 days; ten-peer ratio 0.62280x TYPICAL and five-peer ratio 0.25653x WEAK, both independently reproduced. The tier is peer-sensitive: the ten-peer window includes three WEAK peers that pull the median down, while the five-peer window is dominated by STRONG uploads (Att5nm-UN8M 3.86x, QogQUuyFUx8 4.94x, hvcr7gVbcr0 2.86x), so the classification flips from TYPICAL to WEAK depending on window, and should be reported as TYPICAL-to-WEAK rather than a single tier. Likes 914 (2.32% of views) and comments 70 (0.18%). Evidence-backed interpretation: in its own publication window the channel's STRONG uploads all carried a definite dollar threshold or end state ($100,000 saved fast, live off $500,000, 1/3 of the way to $1,000,000, invest or pay off debt) while this title's outcome is hedged ('Could Change Your Future'); the same split appears in the eight same-channel comparison titles. The later twin vT7IF16WTNg (3.80373x STRONG) shows the $100-per-month topic itself is not a ceiling, but its higher ratio is relative to a different, lower-view peer window nine months later, and it has fewer absolute views, so it is not a controlled comparison. Hypotheses: (a) a hedged outcome with no destination number gives less click intent than the channel's threshold titles; (b) the thumbnail's piggy bank and 'FREEDOM' are abstract and signal saving rather than investing; (c) the long generic motivational tail may have depressed satisfaction signals (like rate 2.32% is lower than some reviewed siblings), though retention is unavailable; (d) the early subscribe request before any value may matter for early drop-off, untestable here. Proposed experiment: in owned uploads, test the same compounding script under a definite-outcome title ('$100 a Month for 40 Years = $349,000 (Or $107,000 After Inflation)') versus a hedged 'could change your future' title, with a matched investing-signalling thumbnail, measuring CTR, impressions and retention at the projection section. None of these hypotheses is measurable here without impressions, CTR, traffic sources or retention.","39,434 views; 914 likes; 70 comments; 1,301 seconds; 0.62280x TYPICAL ten-peer / 0.25653x WEAK five-peer (peer-sensitive tier). Public metrics only.",Evergreen beginner-investing topic with plausible search demand for '$100 a month investing'; historical search demand unavailable.,Published 2025-08-08; no news catalyst identified or claimed; Google Trends history not fetched.,"jZBATMmSBAg 0.63933x TYPICAL; Att5nm-UN8M 3.85935x STRONG; BSlwkVIozNo 0.56009x TYPICAL; QogQUuyFUx8 4.93852x STRONG; hvcr7gVbcr0 2.85698x STRONG; HEtVmp38D4M 3.64145x STRONG; kVpJ1Elw680 0.15245x WEAK; TFtBWn9CWOU 2.11005x STRONG; Ke8nD2zCzmE 0.24125x WEAK; zppYzhlGiOc 0.46591x WEAK. Five of ten age peers are STRONG, all with a definite dollar threshold or decision frame; three are WEAK.",21:41 long-form motivational explainer with one numeric core section and a long habit/mindset tail; cartoon thumbnail; runtime is not watch time.,"TYPICAL in the ten-peer window and WEAK in the five-peer window during a stretch where five of ten nearby channel uploads were STRONG; the comparison is within-channel, so channel size is roughly held constant within the window but not across the nine-month gap to vT7IF16WTNg.","[""Packaging hypothesis: hedged outcome ('Could Change Your Future') without a destination number may lower click intent relative to threshold titles; CTR/impressions unavailable."", ""Peer-window artefact: the TYPICAL/WEAK split is driven by which neighbours are included; the five-peer window is dominated by unusually STRONG neigh